{
  "readme": [
    "HEARTROT arena geometry. THIS FILE IS THE MAP. Redraw `grid` in a text editor,",
    "then run `python3 tools/gen_map.py` to recompile programs/heartrot/src/map.rs and",
    "packages/client/src/map.ts. Never hand-edit either of those two files.",
    "",
    "Layout: a central open heart chamber (the boss spawns on `B`), four 2-tile-wide",
    "corridors radiating N/S/E/W as the only ways in, four large outer halls broken up",
    "by 2x2 pillars, and four edge entrances marked `E`. The 2-wide fronts are the",
    "difficulty system: a corridor has almost no perimeter, so two players hold one;",
    "the halls have perimeter everywhere, which is where a fight goes wrong.",
    "",
    "gen_map.py refuses to emit a map whose entrances cannot reach the heart, whose",
    "spawn points sit in a wall, or whose dimensions disagree with the Rust constants."
  ],
  "tile_size": 16,
  "legend": {
    "#": "wall (solid)",
    ".": "floor",
    "E": "floor, entrance - must flood-fill to the heart",
    "B": "floor, heart of the chamber - the boss spawn tile"
